# The published image ships the PRR-only bookshelf: the 7 in-scope PRR400
# study-unit books (units 2-6, 12 and 14) plus the shared infra (root files,
# lib/, assets/). Everything else under site/ belongs to other modules or
# upstream sample books and is excluded.
site/*
!site/index.html
!site/404.html
!site/_redirects
!site/lib/
!site/assets/covers/prr2-divorce.webp
!site/assets/covers/prr3-application-proceedings.webp
!site/assets/covers/prr4-maintenance.webp
!site/assets/covers/prr5-child-law.webp
!site/assets/covers/prr6-domestic-violence.webp
!site/assets/covers/prr12-ethics.webp
!site/assets/covers/prr14-legal-costs.webp
